<h2 id="honors--awards">Honors &amp; Awards</h2>
<ul>
  <li><span style="color:#305CDE"><strong>Best Paper Award, The 38th Annual Conference on Human &amp; Cognitive Language Technology (HCLT2026)</strong> </span> <br />
  ▶️ Paper: 법률 판단에서의 LLM Overswitching: 국가명 신호 효과 분석 (LLM Overswitching in Legal Judgments: An Analysis of Country-Name Cue Effects) <br />
  ▶️ Paper: 희소 오토인코더를 활용한 대규모 언어 모델의 한국어 언어현상 처리 양상 분석 (Analyzing Korean Linguistic Phenomena in Large Language Models with Sparse Autoencoders) <br />
  ▶️ Paper: 문화 및 언어 특성 기반 다중 LLM을 통한 다국어 의료 대화 데이터셋 구축 (Multilingual Medical Dialogue Dataset Construction Using Multiple LLMs with Cultural and Linguistic Adaptation) <br />
  ▶️ Paper: AFlow 기반 워크플로우 최적화를 활용한 서베이 논문 생성 (Automatic Survey Generation with AFlow-based Workflow Optimization) <br /></li>
  <li><span style="color:#305CDE"><strong>Received Korea University Best Paper Award 2023</strong></span> <br /></li>
  <li><span style="color:#305CDE"><strong>Received Naver Ph.D. Fellowship 2022</strong></span> <br /></li>
  <li><span style="color:#305CDE"><strong>1st place in Quality Estimation Shared Task 2022 - Sentence-level “Critical Error Detection”, WMT 2022 (EMNLP 2022)</strong> </span> <br /></li>
  <li><span style="color:#305CDE"><strong>Best Paper Award, The 34th Annual Conference on Human &amp; Cognitive Language Technology (HCLT2022)</strong> </span> <br />
  ▶️ Paper: KoCED: 윤리 및 사회적 문제를 초래하는 기계번역 오류 탐지를 위한 학습 데이터셋 (KoCED: English-Korean Critical Error Detection Dataset) <br /></li>
  <li><span style="color:#305CDE"><strong>Best Paper Award, The 33rd Annual Conference on Human &amp; Cognitive Language Technology (HCLT2021) - NLP Application 2 Section</strong> </span> <br />
  ▶️ Paper: KommonGen: 한국어 생성 모델의 상식 추론 평가 데이터셋 (KommonGen: A Dataset for Korean Generative Commonsense Reasoning Evaluation) <br /></li>
